Port lowntfs-3g to the libfuse 3 API, for libfuse with the Fusetta mount
backend (hsorbo/tap/libfuse) on macOS.

- configure.ac: --with-fuse=external uses fuse3 >= 3.10.0.
- src/Makefile.am: FUSE_USE_VERSION 31; only lowntfs-3g is built (ntfs-3g,
  the high-level driver, is not ported).
- src/lowntfs-3g.c: fuse_session_new/fuse_session_mount/_unmount, rename
  flags (RENAME_NOREPLACE; RENAME_EXCHANGE is EINVAL), no macFUSE xattr
  position/xtimes, and on macOS: no fuseblk, volname= from the NTFS label,
  streams_interface=openxattr by default (as with user_xattr).

