-			AC_MSG_ERROR([FUSE >= 2.6.0 was not found. Either older FUSE is still present, or FUSE is not fully installed (e.g. fuse, libfuse, libfuse2, libfuse-dev, etc packages). Source code: http://fuse.sf.net])
